 by some analysts following stronger-than-expected results released yesterday. Ahead of results later today, Cheung Kong (0001.HK) flat at HK$96.55, \uc2 Hutchison Whampoa\uc2  (0013.HK) down 0.2% at HK$52.90, Swire (0019.HK) flat at HK$98.05. Taifook notes, speculation of further monetary easing in run-up to FOMC meeting Tuesday may continue to depress greenback near-term. "The local market will remain resilient and speculative buying on dollar-sensitive stocks such as airlines, oil and other basic material stocks may attract particular buying interest." Lower USD likely to support prices of commodities and those airline firms with USD-denominated debts. Volume brisk at HK$11.81 billion. (susanna.tai@dowjones.com) [ 08-04-10 2329ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100805e6850002n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
