bout the yen's surge to a 14-year high against the dollar. It expanded the scheme in March. (Reporting by Leika Kihara)\par \par \uc2 JAPAN-ECONOMY/YAMAGUCHI (URGENT)|LANGEN|J|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|NAT|O|OIL|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|UKI|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100721e67l000ai\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
