\par\par \b \uc2 U.S.-Japan yield spreads may signal more yen gains\b0\par\par\uc2 By Tamawa Desai   \par \uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 2010\par 12:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, May 28 (Reuters) - Further falls in U.S. Treasury yields, which are closely correlated with the dollar/yen rate, could trigger yen gains that would raise alarm for Japanese policymakers.\par \par \uc2 The euro zone debt crisis prompted investors to flock to highly liquid U.S. Treasuries, pushing the spread between U.S. and Japanese bond yields to below 2.0 percent from a peak of around 2.6 percent in early April, according to Reuters data. <US10YT=RR> <JP10YT=RR>\par \par \uc2 At the same time, the dollar fell within sight of the year's low of 87.95 yen <JPY=>, from around 94 yen last month.\par \par \uc2 As euro zone governments battle to trim their deficits and restore confidence in the euro, further destabilisation could push investors into U.S. Treasuries again and drive yields down.\par \par \uc2 The yield on 10-year notes fell earlier this week to 3.06 percent, its lowest since the end of April last year, before bouncing back to 3.32 percent by Friday.\par \par \uc2 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\par \par \uc2 Graphic on U.S.-Japan bond spread and exchange rate\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://graphics.thomsonreuters.com/10/US_USDJPY0510.gif"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://graphics.thomsonreuters.com/10/US_USDJPY0510.gif}}}\par \par \uc2 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\par \par \uc2 Analysts say the correlation between the U.S.-Japanese government bond yield spread and dollar/yen has been especially high since the start of the year, and was last around +0.88, according to Reuters charts.\par \par \uc2 Japanese investors are well invested in U.S. government paper, and remain sensitive to their yields.\par \par \uc2 RATE CHECK\par \par \uc2 "The U.S-Japan yield spread is fairly tight and contributes to downward pressure on dollar/yen," said Lee Hardman, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at \uc2 Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi\uc2  UFJ.\par \par \uc2 "A sharp rise in the yen would be very painful for Japanese corporates and is a growing risk."\par \par \uc2 When the dollar hit a 15-year low of 84.82 yen in late November last year, traders said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which acts as the government's agent in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was in the market checking rates, indicating official concern about the yen's rapid rise.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has refrained from yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 2004. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy is controlled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But any further rapid yen rise from current levels would deal a heavy blow to Japanese exporters and dent the economy.\par \par \uc2 Many Japanese exporters are already hurting as they had set their target rate at around 120 yen per euro this year. The spot rate was last around 113 yen <EURJPY=> on Friday. Against the dollar, companies have projected the dollar to trade around 91.00 yen for the fiscal year ending next March, according to the Bank of Japan's March tankan survey. The dollar last stood at 91.15 yen.\par \par \uc2 "While the yen is often mentioned as being bought as a safe asset, it should be noted that the dollar/yen rate moves in tandem with U.S. rates as well as U.S.-Japan long-term interest rate differentials," said Hideo Kumano, chief economist at Dai-ichi Life Research Institute in Tokyo.\par \par \uc2 (Graphic by Scott Barber)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 /YEN|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100528e65s000ot\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
